-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 26 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Rodrigo Brito

- Initial package for Lyra OS basic parental controls:
  * the lyra-supervised system group (sysusers);
  * an sshd drop-in that denies the group, reloading sshd if it runs;
  * /etc/pam.d/login = vendor login + pam_access, so supervised accounts
    cannot log in on a text console while GDM is unchanged. %check fails
    when /usr/lib/pam.d/login changes, so the copy is refreshed.
  * a dconf profile for supervised accounts that locks the Alt+F2
    command line (org.gnome.desktop.lockdown disable-command-line),
    selected by a systemd user environment generator only for members
    of lyra-supervised.
